Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我出生之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vampire and Lycan clans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼和狼人已经交战了几个世纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been at war for centuries before I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无休无止的冲突 不为人类所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their endless conflict, hidden from the human world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被一只吸血鬼转化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was turned by a vampire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,并由此获得了对抗狼人的力量 得以为家人报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and given the strength to avenge my family against the lycans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已炉火纯青{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was good at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我遇到了迈克尔·柯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I found Michael Corvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A human{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但被转化成了一种既非吸血鬼也非狼人的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was turned to neither Vampire nor Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是二者的混合体 一切由此变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the hybrid of the two. And everything changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,盟友变成死敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allies turned enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保护了六个多世纪的吸血鬼长老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Vampire Elders I have protected for over six centuries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却要除掉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now wanted me dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We retaliated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了长老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed the Elders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历一段短暂的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for a brief moment of time, we were safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不料 又一轮暗潮渐涌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then… A new darkness arose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从非人物种首次曝光之后的九天以来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the nine days since the first discovery of the non-human species, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大量的所谓密穴也浮出水面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scores of so call cavern have been uncovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能被感染的人数突飞猛涨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The estimate of the number of people infected has skyrocketed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military sources confirmed that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗这些非人物种的主要手段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the primary measures of defense against the non-humans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是紫外线和银{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are based on ultraviolet light and silver, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时对被感染者也非常致命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the infected appear to have fatal sensitivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市周围的路障点都设置了检测处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tents have been posted at every barricade around the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,用以检测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A test will be administered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,市民是否感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to verify if you're clear of the infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！你干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们展开了第二波攻势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We begin our second attack wave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用对被感染者致命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}using ultraviolet and silver nitrate ammunitions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫外线和硝酸银弹药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which are deadly to the infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于形势混乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to the volatile situation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时前发布了戒严令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}martial law was declared two hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人因此事件失去了亲友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of us have lost loved ones to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些恶徒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 你无法救助他人或自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please note that you cannot help them or yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个惊人的发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shocking discovery of not one but two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类群体里共存着两种异种 并非一种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}distinct species may have been co-existing within human population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看来吸血鬼和狼人的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The existence of vampires and werewolves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了坚实的事实依据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now appears to have actuall basis and facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,事发城市仍然不愿透露最新状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city remains reluctant to share any new information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但根据我们收到的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are getting reports from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,此城市似乎正在进行大规模清洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what appears to be a mass cleansing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,无药可治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人倒下！有人倒下！- 天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man down! Man down! - God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:25.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑夜传说4：觉醒》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这场清洗中 人类停止了互相残杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purge… Human beings no longer kill each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是他们一直等待的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the enemy they've been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有逃离才能活命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape has become our only chance of survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 迈克尔和我准备离开 今晚就动身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, Michael and I are leaving… tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,德尔塔六号 追捕行动中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta 6, in pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Get down on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备 确保随时能出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be here any minute. Make sure ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,探戈小队就位中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango unit, moving into position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现混种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the hybrid in sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开火 捉活的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire, we need this one alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,德尔塔小组就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team "Delta" is in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意背面！- 安全！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch your back! - Secure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法小队就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha unit is in position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（码头）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,装配银榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming silver grenade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克尔！- 开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael! - Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿尔法四号 推进！- 可以开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alpha 4, move in! - Free to fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回收尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrieve the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号实验体已逃脱！安保小组请警戒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject 2 has escaped! Security units on alert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,解冻程序启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defrost sequence initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号冷冻仓正在降压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lowering compression in subject 1 cryo chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,解冻程序完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defrost sequence complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全警报 位置六层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A security violation, level 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,围捕人员速往六层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All containment personnel to level 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号实验体逃走了 应该还在这楼里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject 2 escaped. It's somewhere in the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一号实验体执行一级防范禁闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the subject one on full lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a status.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号实验体已逃脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject one is broken free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须立刻对其进行闪光灼烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to flash burn it immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 我先看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her back to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在释放最大剂量芬太尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Releasing maximum dose of fentanyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men and security personel clear the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这！停下！不许动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is here! Stop! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,六层有多人伤亡 请保持警戒状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple casualties on level 6. Back to alert status.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备全力追捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for full containment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被逼入死路了 快派保安来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is cornered. Sent security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让她走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会带我们找到二号实验体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can lead us to subject 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！让她走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Don't shoot! Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention! All units.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号和二号实验体已经逃出了包围！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject #1 and #2 have escaped the perimeter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,外围警卫人员请高度警戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security out of gate, use extreme caution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,若发现感染疫情 请向联邦政府报告{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吸血鬼牙齿 真的狼人牙齿{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,码头{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:15:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的？ 这里不允许进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! How did you get in there? You are not allowed in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 码头关闭了 - 什么时候关闭的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pier is closed. - Since when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约十二年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 12 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大清洗之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the cleansing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么问这个？ 你没事吧 女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You okay, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意 代码三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all units. Code 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下通道三十九号出口发生袭击事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Com receiving a report of assault exit 39, under pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者可能是异种 小心行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible non-human aggressor. Proceed with cautious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾病防治中心正在赶来 所有单位请回复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}CDC already enroute. All area units respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士？ 女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am? Hey! Ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you doing over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再往前走了！赶紧回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there! Get back here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那是什么 都不可能逃得太远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever it is, they couldn't have made it very far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通知疾病防治中心小心警戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll alert the CDC to keep an eye out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在赶来的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are enroute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这伤势不可能是人类造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way this attack was human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可说不准 - 说不准什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know that. - Don't know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙被撕烂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy is shreded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的喉咙在水沟里找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His throat was found in the gutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, let me handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要处理什么？ 明显是狼人的毒手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to handle? This is Lycan written all over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 你上次听说狼人杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, when was the last time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you heard about a report of a Lycan killing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你加入这部门有几年了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many years have you been with this department?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？ 我加入三个月了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? I've been here for three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不就结了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,多长点见识再来质疑我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You question me last until you know a bit more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清楚了吗？ - 非常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You clear? - Crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安警探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Sebastian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 我们刚得到报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, we just received a report, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗原实验室发生了状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there has been a disturbance at Antigen Labs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有目击者称似乎有东西逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eyewitness says there may have been an escape, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有个人跳窗而出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said someone jumped out of a window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是首要调查任务 请尽快赶去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a priority investigation. We need you over there ASAP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走吧 约翰逊 这交给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go. Johnson, you're the lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里谁负责？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in charge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 有个塞巴斯蒂安警探说要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a Detective Sebastian here to see you, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪？ - 在大厅 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - In the lobby, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以放心情况已经得到控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be relieved to know the situation is well under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重复一遍 得到了控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, well under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也重复一遍 发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对 你得写报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. There're report to be filed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的一个实验体试图逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our test subject attempted to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不将其处理掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were forced to put it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.49,0:18:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说没有什么跑出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nothing got out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一发榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a stray bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实验体呢？ - 闪光灼烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the subject? - Flash burned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will that be all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一桩 你多虑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few things to attend to, you could imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 我们接到一通匿名电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, we've received an anonymous call{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说有不明物体跳窗逃出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something else escaped through a window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 我们抗原实验室的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, our mission in Antigen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是研发预防感染的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to develop ways to preventing infection, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会将其释放到人群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not releaseing it into the general population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子就是感染致死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my son due to this decease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关人民安危{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no room for error with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能犯错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to the safety of the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要真有什么逃出去 我会通知官方人员的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something had escaped, authorities will be notified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是官方人员 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an authority, are you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 恕我告辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责的家伙说没事 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy in charge says its nothing. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's bullshit. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我去报告吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to report it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气 我帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not mind, I can do it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我逃离的那个囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner that helped me escape, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们称之为二号实验体的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one you called subject two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是个混种吗？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was it a hybrid? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们拿我们干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助政府鉴别被感染者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help the government identifying the infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想使用你们的DNA{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were using your DNA to try to find a cure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到阻止疾病再爆发的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent another outbreak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉你 说我会带你们找到那个混种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told that I will lead you to the hybrid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于二号实验体的信息高度保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject two is a restricted information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有权限 - 你撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have the clearance. - You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 求你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之间有某种联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is some kind of connection between you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一旦靠近彼此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brain waves fall into sync, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑电波会趋于同步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever you're close to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的视感是相通的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see through each other's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 别！是我放你走的！\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't! I'm the one who let you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:20:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们扯平了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪吓人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去叫增援 - 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm calling it in. - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.39,0:22:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是同族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.85,0:22:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要跟踪我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you following me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们监听了警察的无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We monitored the police frequencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what attacked that human back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 桥下的那个人类吗？ - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Under the bridge? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然所剩无几 但就是这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What remains of them, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.16,0:23:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大清洗后他们就像老鼠一样躲在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been hiding down here like rats, ever since the purge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍受着饥饿和病痛 却从未现于天日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desease and starving, they have never jump above ground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明有样东西让他们惶恐不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means there is something has got them wound up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些你不想告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you're not telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.07,0:24:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识她吗？ - 不认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know her? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.94,0:24:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就会大举袭来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will come back in numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把她留在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave her here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.97,0:24:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这辆车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the van!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.62,0:24:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in! Move! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.35,0:25:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三只追过来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of them are behind us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.31,0:26:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后面去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.19,0:26:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的畜生 去死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking beast, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.43,0:28:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无法自愈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有医生能治疗她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a doctor that can help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.95,0:28:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的密穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our cavern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.13,0:28:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.93,0:28:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号实验体 你是一号实验体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject 2. You are subject 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.39,0:28:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我释放了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I freed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.60,0:28:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们告诉我 我没有母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me that I have no mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.01,0:28:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她生我时死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she died when I was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never believed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感应到了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt… you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.81,0:28:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到你双眼所见之物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw images through your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.76,0:29:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来有人在我门外说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then someone outside my door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我长大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said since I was no longer a child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要再等下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wait was over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'll be dead soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.71,0:29:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而与我一墙之隔的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That my own mother, right next door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.97,0:29:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,将永远不会知道我的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will never even know I existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.56,0:29:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你父亲 他们怎么告诉你的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they tell you of your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.97,0:29:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定告诉了你些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must've told you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感应他的所见吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see images through him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.33,0:29:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 只有你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Only you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.39,0:29:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.33,0:29:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从未离开过实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's never stepped foot outside the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么可能在外生存？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could she possibly survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白向官方报告她已逃跑很冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the risk of reporting her escape to the authorities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.14,0:29:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有任何出生记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no record of her birth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以定会引起诸多疑问 这点我很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so questions will be asked, I am well aware of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:29:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she dies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.60,0:30:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多年的研究心血就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all our years of research would've been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 别对我指手划脚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lida, don't tell me how to do my job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的职业操守都丢哪里去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not take a look at your own professional conduct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直想把这玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how your continual need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.11,0:30:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当成人类看待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to endow this creature with human traits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这导致了多少安全隐患？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has led to the lackness of security protocols?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.23,0:30:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它根本不是人类！更不是你的孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a human being! And it's not your child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着呵护怜爱它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not to en cuddle and pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.71,0:30:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就是个低等的牲畜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blite of nature!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.23,0:30:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心了 它自己会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop worrying. It'll come back to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.07,0:31:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快叫奥利维亚过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Olivia at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.68,0:32:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又一次坏了我的规矩 为什么{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被袭击了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.86,0:32:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无法自愈{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.35,0:32:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此你竟不顾我们的安全{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.68,0:32:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必害怕我们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会蠢到相信你的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm foolish enough to take you with your word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个死亡使者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to fear the death dealer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.58,0:32:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的「情狼」杀害了我们的两位长老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who fell in love with a Lycan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.63,0:32:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们不应该感到害怕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who murdered two of our elders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.97,0:32:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还三番五次地背叛同族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with every turn has betrayed her own kind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.65,0:32:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道她是谁吗？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know who this is? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.59,0:32:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是父亲 是我们背叛她在先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was we who first betrayed her, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.82,0:32:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.27,0:32:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能自愈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.68,0:33:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被一只低等狼人袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was attacked by a lower Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.85,0:33:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.41,0:33:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的自愈能力在起效但被削弱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her self repair is active but weakened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.88,0:33:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上没有咬痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has no origin bite marks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有伤疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or scars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况的孩子我从未见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a child like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你上一次吸食是什么时候？ - 吸食？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When did you last feed? - Feed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.15,0:33:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她吸血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.41,0:33:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你必须{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child, you must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.03,0:34:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly… slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.13,0:34:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在自愈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.63,0:34:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速度很快 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And quickly. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.88,0:34:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她到我的房间去 她需要休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to my room. She needs the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都不相信 他们真的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never believed it, they do exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.25,0:34:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的同族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 父亲 她不止是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's something more, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于她你知道些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.27,0:34:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我被囚禁在一个叫抗原实验室的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was held captive at a place called Antigen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.18,0:35:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个囚犯释放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the other prisoners freed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为是迈克尔·柯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed it was Michael Corvin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.58,0:35:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我知道的唯一一个混种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only hybrid I knew existed at that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.26,0:35:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你那狼族爱人早就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, your Lycan lover long dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.61,0:35:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这到底是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.75,0:35:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.27,0:35:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一恢复体力 我就带着她离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as she regain her strength, I will leave with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.42,0:36:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾听过死亡使者的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to hear stories of the death dealers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说他们仅存于历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were a thing of the past…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.29,0:36:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…never to returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.39,0:36:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴这些传说是错的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad they were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.91,0:36:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早知道我是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.64,0:36:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是把我带到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, you still brought me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.13,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多你这样的人来指导我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use more like you to teach us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.05,0:36:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只怕你父亲不会同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish only your father would agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.15,0:36:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有一段时间他同意过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when he would've.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.10,0:36:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么他这么讨厌你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he dislike you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.49,0:36:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 这让他回想起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think… it reminds him of the days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,用火焰钢铁保护我们的岁月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he defended us with fire and steel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.54,0:36:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是一大堆空话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than hollow words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.32,0:36:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们有多需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he knows how much we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是当领袖的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.40,0:36:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你为信仰而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you fight for what you believe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.69,0:36:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.20,0:36:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该相信什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I believe in anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不认识这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recognize this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.19,0:36:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you haven't changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.07,0:36:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你看那个孩子的眼神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw in your eyes when you look at the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.39,0:37:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会保护她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.00,0:37:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种本能融于血液 这就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your blood. It's who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.68,0:37:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开时带上我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you leave, take me with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.56,0:38:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You distrust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.02,0:38:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不信任我 你觉得我不欢迎你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do. I made you feel unwelcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此我感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.12,0:38:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.83,0:38:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很特别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.29,0:38:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚你是什么物种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.09,0:38:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲说如果我们种族能存活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father says should we survive as a species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.52,0:39:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些遗迹会告诉我们的后人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These relics will help our descendants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.36,0:39:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是什么 我们如何生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know who we were and how we live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.69,0:39:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.63,0:39:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们还像现在这样生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That if we continue to live as we do now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.01,0:39:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有辱祖先以及无颜面对未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we disgrace the past and don't deserve the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须抵抗人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must resist the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.08,0:39:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论何时何地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever and whenever possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.24,0:39:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第一轮和第二轮大清洗之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the first and second purges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼族的年轻人联合了起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the lycan youth rallied in the same way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.65,0:39:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗人类军队 保护年长者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the troop and serve their elders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.93,0:39:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们呼吁以暴制暴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their calls for violent action carried today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果 狼族几乎灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The result… the Werewolves are nearly extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.22,0:39:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也希望看到我们灭族吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you wish for us? Extinction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.78,0:39:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还把她的女儿带回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, you bring her offspring into our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you honestly believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会给她自由吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that humans will allow her to remain free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不惜一切代价把她抓回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will hunt her down at any expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.79,0:39:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们可以保护她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can help protect them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.15,0:39:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.38,0:39:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们今晚必须离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll leave tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.70,0:39:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是谨慎的行为 而是头脑简单的懦夫所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't prudence. This is cowardice plain and simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.03,0:39:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大的胆子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.53,0:40:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好大的胆子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,袖手旁观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do so little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.79,0:40:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像一个傻乎乎的小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamt of the day that we would meet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.17,0:40:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数次地梦想我们见面的场景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a silly little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.75,0:40:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和死去的那个人一样铁石心肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as cold as one who's already dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.03,0:40:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 我还和你爸爸在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday … I was with your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.62,0:41:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我和他的距离比你我更远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was a little bit further away from me than you are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我睡着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.75,0:41:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第二天醒来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I awoke the next day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.25,0:41:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道一夜之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learn that over night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.45,0:41:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二年已经过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 years have passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.31,0:41:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深爱的那个男人离我远去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of the only man I ever loved, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.05,0:41:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个小女孩有着和他一样的双眸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this little girl with his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.85,0:41:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是铁石心肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart is not cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.45,0:41:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是心碎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.07,0:41:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.29,0:41:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.13,0:42:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里等我回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. Wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.71,0:42:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 带上我 求你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, take me with you. Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.56,0:42:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让任何人伤害你的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't let anyone hurt you. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.35,0:42:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁好门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.07,0:42:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都到避难所去！马上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone into the shelter! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.46,0:42:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备武器 - 听我的 走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prepare the armory. - Do as I say. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我的！- 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pay heed to me! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.11,0:42:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 奋勇抵抗！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand and we fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.01,0:42:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！你很危险！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You're not safe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.31,0:42:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我住手 马上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.04,0:42:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里平安生活了多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lived safely for years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.39,0:42:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你把人类卷入这个契约中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you brought humans to this covenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.72,0:42:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要那个女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want the girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:42:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得到她他们是不会罢休的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will stop at nothing to get her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.90,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天总会到来 无论有没有我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This day was bound to come. With or without us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.65,0:43:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上武器回击 大家一起上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move! Munitions, let's go. Everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.80,0:43:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就几个人 会被灭族的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no more than a handful of fighters. We'll be annihilated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.10,0:43:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的计划呢 父亲？ 我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's your plan, father? Let's go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.08,0:43:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里？ - 带她离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - To get her away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.37,0:43:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲说得没错 我们不该来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is right. We shouldn't have come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.10,0:43:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不明白 - 人类会跟着我们离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't understand what… - The humans will follow us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.74,0:43:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我拖住他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just need to hold them off until then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.40,0:43:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做都是为了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.35,0:43:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我们都强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's more powerful than any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.57,0:43:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们担心她发现自己能力的那天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they fear the day she discovers it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.27,0:43:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带她离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get her out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.05,0:44:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lycans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.76,0:44:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver ammunition. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.24,0:44:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.14,0:45:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.69,0:45:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.44,0:45:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.10,0:46:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.07,0:46:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.62,0:46:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带她去安全的地方 - 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take her somewhere safe. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.83,0:46:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她走 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？ - 他们把她带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - They took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.52,0:49:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她作为礼物送给了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They accepted her. As a gift from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.31,0:50:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在做什么吗？ 你有想过后果吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know what you've done? Do you have any idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.04,0:50:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么做？ 殊死搏斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you had me do? Fight to the last, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.78,0:50:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去保护一个使我们陷入灾难的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect the very one who brought this upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.46,0:50:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们战败了 契约被摧毁 我儿子也死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are defeated, our covenant is destroyed and my son is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.98,0:50:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.39,0:50:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他帮了你的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he helped that child of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.21,0:50:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们要杀她 去杀好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they'll kill her, so be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.88,0:50:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子的死是因为他为了你们在战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son died because he was fighting for all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.48,0:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道逃亡不是长久之计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he knew that running is not survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.75,0:51:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是狼人 还没灭族 反而更强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been lycans. Not extinct. More powerful than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.49,0:51:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是我以前见到的狼人的两倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing was more than twice the size of any Lycan I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们躲藏了十年之后赫然现身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They risk showing themselves after more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.18,0:51:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a decade in hiding because of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.46,0:51:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你居然把她拱手相送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you handed her over to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.77,0:51:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是亚历山大·柯文纳斯唯一的直系血脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the last direct descendant of Alexander Corvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.37,0:51:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼和狼人现存唯一的混血儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only hybrid child that is ever existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.76,0:51:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论狼人想从她身上得到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is the Lycans want from her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.46,0:51:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子都深知这值得他用生命捍卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your son knew it was worth dying for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.24,0:51:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.69,0:52:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.14,0:53:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群狼人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A force of two dozen Lycans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.87,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚突然袭击破坏了我们的契约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}attacked and destroyed one of our covenants last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.04,0:53:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然一点都不惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.75,0:53:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道狼人没有灭族 怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew the Lycans were not extinct. How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.97,0:53:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是一种直觉 - 我不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a feeling. - I'm not good with feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.07,0:53:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 这里不适合谈这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to know how. - This is not the place for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.03,0:53:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也不会杀了我 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're not gonna kill me. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.69,0:54:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 因为你根本不需要一把破枪来杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because you wouldn't need a fucking gun to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.46,0:54:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.41,0:54:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府宣布对狼人的作战任务已经完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the government declared mission accomplished on all Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.61,0:54:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府宣称我们的唯一目标就是你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feds announced that we were to only focus on your kind now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.21,0:54:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个月前 一个朋友给我送来了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months ago, a friend of mine sent me this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.23,0:54:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It arrived two days after{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.45,0:54:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被发现吊死在吊扇上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was found hanging from his own ceiling fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.37,0:54:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百个狼人嫌疑犯 每个案例都调查了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}200 suspected Lycan captures. Every case was investigated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.09,0:54:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个血液样本都呈阴性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every blood test came back negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.97,0:54:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我朋友开始怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my friend began to wonder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.17,0:54:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是被误导了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were they all false leads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.07,0:54:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有人在保护狼人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or someone trying to protect the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.93,0:54:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他们补充重组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping them to replenish thier packs letting them regroup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.69,0:54:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己部门的人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your own department?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.64,0:54:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓了我女儿 我只想让她回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have my daughter. All I care about is getting her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.60,0:54:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要保护谁 我不关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're protecting someone, I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.97,0:54:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在追踪狼人 我只想找回我女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not after them. I just want her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.67,0:54:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！即便我的部门里有这样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Even if there are others in my department{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.24,0:54:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也没有这个权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wouldn't have the authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.77,0:55:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要更高级别 我想可能要到最高层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes much higher. I believe all the way to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.14,0:55:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者是基层？ - 你什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the bottom? - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.86,0:55:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁负责这项检测？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who administers the tests?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.68,0:55:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多 麻烦看下这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're short on time, so if you please take a look at these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.21,0:55:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份时间表详细勾勒出从今天我们休会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The schedule will take you from the moment we adjourn today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.71,0:55:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到疫苗的最后生产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}straight through to the final manufacture of the vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.48,0:55:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们遵照这个时间表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stick to this plan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.01,0:55:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,接种会在三个月内得以实施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}inoculation should begin within 3 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.84,0:55:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有别的问题吗？ 现在赶紧提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions? Now it's the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.93,0:55:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天的手术结束后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because after today's surgery…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.17,0:55:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再会有联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there'll be no communication between us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.31,0:55:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次见面就是在疫苗接种中心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we meet up again in the inoculation center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.70,0:55:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 根据你的测试实验体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, in terms of your test subject, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.78,0:55:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对银还是免疫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he continues to demonstrate immunity to silver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.59,0:55:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.34,0:55:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且额外的接种只是作为一种预防{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And additional inoculations administered only as precaution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能带来的副作用是我们难以想象的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have triggered side effects we never imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.26,0:55:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量暴增{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vast increases in strenght.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.55,0:55:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉猛长 自我愈合 精力充沛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muscle mass, self-healing. Stamina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.82,0:56:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过她对我们的研究至关重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she was essential to our research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.11,0:56:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一直是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and will continue to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.14,0:56:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做？ 解剖她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? By dissecting her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.65,0:56:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你太无礼了 - 我很担心这个小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You weren't meant have that. - I care for this little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.65,0:56:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来 你希望我坐视不理而你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these years and you expect me to sit by while you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.04,0:56:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,收获的是遗传物质 我对你别无所求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvest, it's genetic material. I expect nothing from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.23,0:56:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我雇你来照看它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired you to look after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.18,0:56:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,总的来说 你干得很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the most part, you did an excellent job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.72,0:56:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挽救了成千上万人的生命 - 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Saving the lives of thousands. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.87,0:56:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个种族免于灭亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire species saved from extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.49,0:56:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.49,0:57:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天过后 注射间隔会缩短{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After today, you won't have to wait so long between injections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.26,0:57:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定她准备好了吗？ - 雌性激素升高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure she's ready? - Estrogen levels high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.37,0:57:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,经期稳定 发育成熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}intervals between menstruations holding steady. It's come of age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.35,0:57:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事俱备 如我们所愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's worked out. Just as we'd hoped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.73,0:57:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是功臣 我为你骄傲 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the first proof. I am proud of you, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.87,0:58:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然她又回到我们手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that she's with us again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.95,0:58:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有了一切所需的基因材料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have all the genetic material that we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.71,0:58:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始克隆生产出无尽的疫苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for cloning enough to produce an endless supply of vaccine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下 我们的种族对银免疫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine… Our species immune to silver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.32,0:58:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要躲躲藏藏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们治愈下的每一个狼人都能和你一样强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Lycan under our command as powerful as you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.53,0:58:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至开始为自己注射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even begun injecting myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.77,0:58:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望妈妈能目睹这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wish mother were here to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.23,0:58:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈选择做一个人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother chose to remain human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.39,0:58:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抛弃了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She abandoned us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.72,0:58:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.47,0:58:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.38,0:59:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你对抗原实验室的看法是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you're right about "Antigen", {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.98,0:59:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道有多少狼人藏在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows how many lycans are hiding in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前脚刚进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second when you step foot inside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.16,0:59:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就会被包围 - 我倒希望这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you gonna be surrounded. - I'm hoping so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.47,0:59:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想救她 我可以帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want her back. I can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.65,0:59:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 告诉我你的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Just tell me what your plan is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.92,0:59:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是反抗情况越糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse if you try to fight it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.09,0:59:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.17,0:59:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能活在阳光下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it you actually able to survive in the sunlight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.01,0:59:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.52,0:59:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自一个名叫亚历山大·柯文纳斯的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a man named Alexander Corvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.71,1:00:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,国父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Founding father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.47,1:00:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾和一个护士结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be married to a nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.34,1:00:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上班的时候 她被吸血鬼咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day at work, she was bitten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.10,1:00:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没告诉任何人 一起生活了许多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knew but us. We lived like that for a few years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.02,1:00:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就是大清洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then came the purge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.38,1:00:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦工作人员挨家挨户搜查 到了我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feds were conducting door to doors and when they knocked on ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.01,1:00:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉我她爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me she love me and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.51,1:00:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她让阳光照了进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then she let the sunlight in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.09,1:00:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼睁睁看着她烧死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to watch her burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.58,1:01:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能听到吗？ - 听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear me? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.06,1:01:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.30,1:01:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的！是她！- 白天出没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! It's her! - In daylight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.85,1:01:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是她！走！- 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's her! Go! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.98,1:02:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我暗号 - 我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for my cue. - I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.17,1:02:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号A 重复代号A 一级破坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ops code A, repeat ops code A. Breach on level 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.48,1:02:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者攀上四号电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder is asending in evelator 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.40,1:02:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有安保人员马上抵达电梯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All security in the area to the elevator, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.36,1:02:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻醉 准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anesthesia, you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.41,1:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.68,1:02:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保小组请警戒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All security units to be on alert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.66,1:02:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者进入楼内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder on premises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.36,1:02:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有安保人员注意 入侵者进入电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security team alert all units. Intruder is set in the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.91,1:03:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 开始！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.35,1:03:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.27,1:03:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是暗号 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your cue. - Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.66,1:04:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用的是硝酸银气体 到处都在爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using silver nitrate gas. Bombs on all the floors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.14,1:04:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一号实验体 我们得撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's subject 1. We need to evacuate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.66,1:04:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始异丙酚注射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Start the propofol of infusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.92,1:04:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是取消手术 明白吗？ 只是转移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not canceling this procedure, understood? We're moving it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.45,1:04:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现了她 毁了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find her. And you destroy her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.18,1:04:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.40,1:04:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定货车为目标 三号停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. I got movement on a van, parking level 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.97,1:04:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.49,1:04:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在转移 别跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are on the move. Just don't lose them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.72,1:05:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在员工电梯里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is in the service elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.09,1:05:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住她 - 我下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her. - I'm coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.86,1:05:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜！赛琳娜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene! Selene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去往二号停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading to parking level 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜？ 告诉我你在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene? I need to know where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.03,1:05:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.31,1:06:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜 你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.79,1:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她了 我看到她了！二号停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see her! I see her! Parking level 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.92,1:06:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正把你女儿装进货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're loading your daughter into the van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.87,1:06:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜 你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.92,1:06:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.63,1:06:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.91,1:07:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克尔？ - 杀了她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael? - Kill her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.52,1:07:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜 莱恩把她装进货车 他们走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene, Lane has her in the van, they're on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.35,1:07:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？ 他们把她带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? They're leaving with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.89,1:07:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.78,1:09:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.93,1:09:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停！杀了他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop! Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜 他们开向一号停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene, they are heading for parking level 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.22,1:09:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜 他们开向一号停车场 收到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene, they're getting away on parking level 1. Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.89,1:09:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.54,1:10:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好吗？ - 各项指数稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is everything okay? - Levels are holding stable, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.36,1:10:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命体征线…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baseline vitals are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.09,1:12:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.32,1:12:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.82,1:14:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是反抗情况会越糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse if you try to fight it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.41,1:15:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.36,1:16:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能瞬间愈合 - 我替你数着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heal instantly. - I'm counting on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.32,1:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来找我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came back for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.89,1:17:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.57,1:17:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.51,1:17:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得赶快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.73,1:17:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离这儿不远处有个藏身之所 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a safe house, not far from here. - Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.43,1:17:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引开他们 为你争取时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send them on different path, buy you some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.59,1:17:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 来吧 大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Come on, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.76,1:17:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这是回去吗？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're going back in? - We are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.89,1:17:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？ 迈克尔吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.49,1:18:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在顶楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.85,1:18:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事变迁 敌人永存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though the world has changed, our enemy remains the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.17,1:18:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼族会卷土重来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lycans will rebuild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.47,1:18:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将猎杀她的父亲就如当初猎杀她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will hunt for her father as they did for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.41,1:18:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们更强大的同时 我们也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as they grow stronger, so will we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.72,1:18:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼契约将不会存在于这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vampire covenant will not only survive this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.95,1:18:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将重新书写传奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will reclaim it.{\r}
